      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, you think the T-test is fine here? Reviewer 3 specifically flagged the delta-wave measurements in Figure 4 as looking \"thin.\" If you look closely at the raw data in Table 3, the control group has a massive outlier and the distribution is heavily skewed. Wouldn't a non-parametric test be more appropriate there? I'm worried we're overstating the significance.",
